00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:42.890
Y ese cambio

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:43.590
trae su propia serie

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.210
de sorpresas.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:45.970
Su entorno híbrido

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:46.770
son puentes fantasma

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.210
para los datos.

